        <div
          class="
            comment__body
            text-styles
            text-styles--secondary
            body
            
            
          ">
          <p>Speaking as the author of Tokenade, tool-list churn is the cost I would flag first: a date that changes in a tool definition is a cache write nobody asked for. Where the date lives matters more than whether it changes.</p>


