        <div
          class="
            comment__body
            text-styles
            text-styles--secondary
            body
            
            
          ">
          <p>Thanks, and your question is what started this count. Where it lives is most of the story: 286 of the 331 dates sat in tool descriptions, which invalidate the cache from that tool on, while the same date in a tool result would cost only its own few tokens.</p>


